ория.</p>\r\n<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; При наличии свободных мест заезды могут осуществляться в другие дни на любой период.</p>\r\n<p style="text-align: center;"><br /><br /></p>\r\n<p style="text-align: center;">РАФИК ЗАЕЗДОВ НА 2023 ГОД</p>\r\n<p style="text-align: center;">в санаторий &laquo;<strong>Дубровенка</strong>&raquo; РУП &laquo;Могилевское отделение Белорусской железной дороги&raquo;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width="57" valign="top">\r\n<p>№</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="321" valign="top">\r\n<p>Даты   начала и окончания заезда</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="253" valign="top">\r\n<p>Продолжительность   заезда, календарных дней</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width="57" valign="top">\r\n<p>1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="321" valign="top">\r\n<p>09.01 по 21.01</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="253" valign="top">\r\n<p>13</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width="57" valign="top">\r\n<p>2</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="321" valign="top">\r\n<p>23.01 по 09.02</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="253" valign="top">18</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width="57" valign="top">\r\n<p>3</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="321" valign="top">\r\n<p>11.02 по 24.02</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="253" valign="top">14&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width="57" valign="top">\r\n<p>4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="321" valign="top">\r\n<p>27.02 по 16.03</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="253" valign="top">18&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width="57" valign="top">\r\n<p>5</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="321" valign="top">\r\n<p>19.03 по 01.04</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="253" valign="top">\r\n<p>14</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width="57" valign="top">\r\n<p>6</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="321" valign="top">\r\n<p>03.04 по 19.04</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="253" valign="top">\r\n<p>17</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width="57" valign="top">\r\n<p>7</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width="321" valign="top">