(82, 'Фотоконкурс 2012 - детский рисунок', '<p><img class="main" style="float: left;" src="ed/upload-files/images/fotokonkurs/150.png" alt="" width="200" height="185" /></p>\r\n<p>Голосование по конкурсу детского рисунка &laquo;Железная дорога глазами детей&raquo; в 2012 г. ОСТАНОВЛЕНО</p>\r\n<table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="100%">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<h2>ПО Конкурсу детского рисунка &laquo;Железная дорога глазами детей&raquo; до 7 лет &ndash; первая категория</h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="100%">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class="tl" width="27" height="26">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class="tc">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class="tr" width="27" height="26">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class="ml" width="27" height="26">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class="mc"><!--#include virtual="../../../..//cgi-bin/vote/4/pvd_qv.pl" --> \r\n<table class="otctup2" border="0" cellspacing="10" cellpadding="0" width="100%">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align="center">Фото1\r\n<div class="highslide-gallery"><a id="thumb1" class="highslide" onclick="return hs.expand(this)" href="ed/upload-files/images/fotokonkurs/detskirisunok2012/kat1/Antoshkevich_Zlata_5let.jpg"> <img style="border: 5px solid #c0c0c0;" title="Нажмите чтоб расширить" src="ed/upload-files/images/fotokonkurs/detskirisunok2012/kat1/Antoshkevich_Zlata_5letS.jpg" alt="Highslide JS" width="200" height="141" /></a>\r\n<div class="highslide-caption">Фото1</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td align="center">Фото2\r\n<div class="highslide-gallery"><a id="thumb1" class="highslide" onclick="return hs.expand(this)" href="ed/upload-files/images/fotokonkurs/detskirisunok2012/kat1/Cibylskii_Egor_5let1.jpg"> <img style="border: 5px solid #c0c0c0;" title="Нажмите чтоб расширить" src="ed/upload-files/images/fotokonkurs/detskirisunok2012/kat1/Cibylskii_Egor_5let1S.jpg" alt="Highslide JS" /></a>\r\n<div class="highslide-caption">Фото2</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\