(157, 'Фотоотчет туристической поездки в Несвиж', '<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/01-IMG_6390.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="600" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/02-IMG_6417.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="800" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/03-IMG_6429.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="600" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/04-IMG_6450.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="600" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/05-IMG_6465.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="800" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/06-IMG_6474.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="600" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/07-IMG_6475.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="800" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/08-IMG_6479.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="600" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/09-IMG_6482.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="800" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/10-IMG_6483.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="800" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/11-IMG_6489.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="800" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/12-IMG_6512.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="600" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/13-IMG_6514.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="800" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/14-IMG_6515.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="600" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/15-IMG_6523.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="600" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/16-IMG_6525.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="800" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/17-IMG_6528.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="600" /></p>\r\n<p><img src="ed/upload-files/images/news2014/nesvig/18-IMG_653